      "SLSA provenance is a candidate"
    ]
  },
  "non_overlap_rules": [
    "do not move Cockpit TaskCache or tasks_projection into mw-edge",
    "do not persist Radicle issues/patches as mw-edge canonical records",
    "do not replace mw-identity or mw-security",
    "do not turn mw-storage into relational persistence",
    "do not merge apps/webhook into mw-edge",
    "do not register mw-edge as permanent production daemon until a dedicated service-boundary ADR is accepted",
    "do not create generic Cockpit browser proxy /api/data/:model",
    "standalone.principal must never be presented as canonical mw-identity state",
    "standalone superuser must not bypass future integrated authorization boundaries",
    "standalone metadata CRUD API must not become a generic Cockpit /api/data/:model proxy",
    "factory reset must never delete or reseed data outside apps/mw-edge ownership"
