  "final_instruction": "Execute against live bjo163/mw state. Build the mechanism-only kernel, plugin/addon system, native ORM, one-domain-one-database persistence, all business/reference/local-standalone models, metadata-driven UI, standalone Vite application, deterministic seed/bootstrap packs and safe factory reset. Do not stop at planning. Return V0.1_READY only when fresh install and factory reset produce equivalent mandatory baseline state, the standalone UI works without Cockpit, and all mandatory tests/CI gates pass.",
